algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Graph G = (V, E), nice tree decomposition T of width k
Output: CertTree of size <= |E| * 2^(k^2+k)

function compile(node, active_state):
  if node is Leaf:
    return CertTree.leaf(active_edges)
  if node is Forget(v):
    branch over all edges incident to v
    return branch_all(incident_edges, child, state)
  if node is Join:
    merge certificates from both children

Complexity: O(|E| * 2^(k^2+k)) time and space
